e=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Order of St. George</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"house\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">House</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mask\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mask</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Mask\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20241130215907\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Black Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Black_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> — <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black</a><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"White Mask\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/52/White_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20241130215853\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"White Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"White_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> — <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White</a> <small>(formerly)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"position\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Position</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Black Mask Trainee</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"totem\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Totem</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unnamed Doll<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #13</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Maxine Slaughter</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black Mask</a> monster hunter of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. Originally a <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White-Masked</a> pack hunter, Maxine would take on the mantle of the House's only remaining Black Mask after the death of <a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a> and departure of <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>. To achieve this end, she would train first under the <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQm91Y2hlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">House of Boucher</span> in New Orleans, and then the <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ3V0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Cutter</span> in England. Deeply loyal to <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a>, Maxine was told in her training to question the authorities she'd been taught all her life to defer to. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Maxine is a woman of African descent with pink eyes and short, dark hair, styled to favor a Mohawk.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\">Issue #13</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14\">Issue #14</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">Issue #15</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_24\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 24\">Issue #24</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_25\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 25\">Issue #25</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Slaughter\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Slaughter 13 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzEzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Issue #13</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"One-shots\">One-shots</span></h3>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">Book of Slaughter</a></i></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">Book of Butcher</a></i></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\">Book of Cutter</a></i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"794987eb659ca4dfe31905889c27cb15\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:145px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"MaxineSlaughter13-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:143px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:MaxineSlaughter13.png\" title=\"MaxineSlaughter13.png (1.08 MB)\